# playground: nb's Mock provider reads its script from the prompt, so no model answers here.
# model before provider: nb builds the provider's client as soon as it reads `provider`, and a provider
# whose entry names no Model (setup writes none; the arm's model is the suite's choice) cannot be built without one.
model {{model}}
provider {{provider}}
harness {{harness}}
approval bash *
loop 2
budget tool_calls 3
run {{prompt}}
